Description: Capture session plaintext for a disposable honeypot backend
 When sshd logs to its standard error (-e) and that is a pipe, each
 authenticated session process writes its session channels' input, output
 and exit status there as single-write records, beside its log lines. No
 descriptor is added to any process. Otherwise nothing changes.
Forwarded: not-needed
